    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BearPit</strong></i> is another game about dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven exploration of a human's condition, told through living, dreaming, and perspective. With a focus on that feeling of &quot;it's <strong>All Wrong&quot;</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can expect from this game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live in a flat as someone might.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy the things someone may buy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate with things, play with things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use up your energy the way someone might.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then you must sleep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then you may dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then you may wake up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe, just maybe, learn what kind of someone you are.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a life separated by Waking Time and Dream Time, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this life, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unfolding through bizarre dreams,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and spoken of by theatrical characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A life of unknown melancholy, alone and in solitude.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is clear that such a life as the one in this game not only may,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > but positively must, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >be lived in our world today,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by <i>someone</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever felt, that <strong>Pit</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever felt, that feeling?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That something is,\u00a0<strong>All Wrong</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story from the perspective of someone, someone different to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone who has felt that <strong>Pit</strong>, that feeling, and that someone is, <strong>All Wrong</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BearPit\u00a0</strong></i>explores that feeling.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To the bottom of the <strong>Pit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where something is\u00a0<strong>All Wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the perspective of someone, someone different to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone who remembered that feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone who remembered that <strong>Pit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>BearPit:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're going on a <i><strong>Bear</strong></i><strong> </strong>hunt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're going to see a real one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uh-uh! A <strong><i>Pit</i></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whirling\u00a0<strong>un-<i>bear-</i>able</strong>\u00a0<i><strong>Pit</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We can't go <i>above</i> it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We can't go <i>below</i> it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, <strong>you</strong> wretched and fatherless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We have to go through it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere, something <i>counts.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Somewhere, something <i>subtracts.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere, there is a <strong>Bear</strong> in a <strong>Pit</strong><i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618980/extras/6076329d00530edd6918e7d09ca14ab9.avif?t=1743629984\" width=444 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yours sincerely, faithfully and truthfully, A. Firend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
